WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.300
A healthcare claim can look completely ordinary
on its own. The pattern around it might not.

2
00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:19.400
We're building Sequrin to help medical-scheme integrity teams
see more of the context around a claim. We use
rules, statistics and models to surface activity that
may deserve a closer look.

3
00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:32.500
But a signal is only the starting point. We bring
claims, providers, members, facilities, timing and related activity
into the same view, so you can see what an
isolated record leaves out.

4
00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:40.800
That means your investigators can see why something
surfaced, which relationships matter, and where it may
be worth looking next.

5
00:00:40.800 --> 00:00:50.700
We keep the signal, relationships, evidence and case context
together, so your team can follow the investigation without
rebuilding the story across disconnected tools.

6
00:00:50.700 --> 00:01:01.400
Our analytics help decide where to look. Your investigators
determine what the evidence means, and the consequential decision
stays with the authorised people in your organisation.

7
00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:05.000
See the claim. Then see what surrounds it. Sequrin.
